      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture of the code. Let me write the improved test with better understandability: remove unused imports and the unused `basic()` helper, extract the expected string into a named constant, and add a brief comment explaining the emission format.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes unused imports and the unused `basic()` helper, extracts the expected emission string into a named constant with an explanatory comment, splits the long XML fragment string for readability, renames `seen` to `emissionLog`, and adds inline comments clarifying the emission order semantics and `#root` node."
